@constraint p/gb380a5ca16c9-8-1 { status: cited, source: { kind: file, ref: crates/cargo-smysl/src/commands.rs@b380a5ca16c9 }, "code:kind": existing-behaviour, "ingest:quote": "A commit is extracted once per recipe (D7) — `--force` is for a deliberate redo, not for a retry loop." }
~ The tool reads git itself and assigns labels, sources and statuses (D5); the model proposes content only, and …

The tool reads git itself and assigns labels, sources and statuses (D5); the model proposes content only, and every quote it gives is checked against the commit (D8). A commit is extracted once per recipe (D7) — `--force` is for a deliberate redo, not for a retry loop.

